flowchart TD
    O[Owner / Committee]
    SA[Super Admin]
    FE[Frontend]
    API[API NestJS]
    DB[(MariaDB)]

    O -->|1. POST /events| FE
    FE -->|2. buat event, pembuat jadi OWNER, status DRAFTED| API
    API -->|3. insert events + user_event_roles| DB
    O -->|4. konfigurasi: PUT /events/:id (features, visibility, ticket_mode, souvenir_rules)| API
    O -->|5. tambah konten: rundown/sponsor/kontak/speaker/workshop| API
    O -->|6. POST /events/:id/publish-request| API
    API -->|7. status = PENDING| DB
    SA -->|8. GET /events/approval-queue| FE
    FE -->|9. tampilkan antrean PENDING| API
    SA -->|10. PUT /events/:id/approval {status}| API
    API -->|11a. PUBLISHED| DB
    API -->|11b. REJECTED + rejection_reason| DB
    API -->|12. email pemberitahuan ke pemohon| DB

    style O fill:#fff7ed
    style SA fill:#f5f3ff
    style API fill:#e0f2fe